    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "L’Espece explosive"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In this deliciously unhinged mash-up of rural thriller and dark comedy, enormous wild boars create havoc in a small French town."
    },
