    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Wild Horse Nine"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Martin McDonagh continues to mine the absurdities and complexities of male relationships in a film that brims with energy and is sure to delight."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/history-of-concrete-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The History of Concrete"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Having attended a Hallmark movie workshop, John Wilson applies his learnings to a documentary about concrete, albeit with a dryly funny and deceptively understated tone."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/fox-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Fox"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A talking fox, voiced by Olivia Colman, persuades a hunter to transform his cheating wife into an ideal spouse, in this gleefully outrageous, shape-shifting comedy."
    }
  ]
